# 构建上下文裁剪 —— 服务于单测回归「测试镜像」构建（上下文 = 仓库根）：
#   docker build -f clarity-java/Dockerfile                        --target test -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:java-test-<sha>  .
#   docker build -f clarity-go/Dockerfile                          --target test -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:go-test-<sha>    .
#   docker build -f clarity-python/Dockerfile                      --target test -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:py-test-<sha>    .
#   docker build -f clarity-service/clarity-llm/Dockerfile          --target test -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:llm-test-<sha>   .
#   docker build -f clarity-service/clarity-voice/Dockerfile       --target test -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:voice-test-<sha>  .
#   docker build -f clarity-service/clarity-modal/Dockerfile       --target test -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:modal-test-<sha>  .
# 重依赖基础镜像（上下文同为仓库根，tag = uv.lock 指纹，lock 未变则复用）：
#   docker build -f clarity-service/clarity-modal/Dockerfile.base -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:modal-base-08dc5a158a40 .
#   docker build -f clarity-service/clarity-voice/Dockerfile.base -t csighub.tencentyun.com/earthywu/clarity-vision:voice-base-3d01ce25e049 .
# 所有 Python 依赖一律在镜像内 `uv sync --frozen` 自建，任何 .venv / 本地残留都不进上下文。
# 模式不含 / 时只匹配仓库根下的同名项；**/ 开头匹配任意层级。

.git
node_modules
models
datasets
.tmp-mpsrc
.playwright-cli
design-review
*.png

# 本地虚拟环境与残留物（依赖由镜像内 uv sync 自建）
clarity-python/.venv
clarity-service/*/.venv

# GPU 推理代码已迁至 clarity-service/clarity-modal；此目录是迁移后的本地残留、未被 git 跟踪
clarity-python/algorithm

# 与单测回归无关的子项目，整体排除以缩小上下文
clarity-front-vue
clarity-front-react
clarity-taro
clarity-uniapp
clarity_flutter
clarity-react-native
clarity-android
clarity-mobile
clarity-desktop-web
clarity-algorithm
clarity-doc
clarity-paper
clarity-mcp-gateway
clarity-sdk-js
clarity-vision
clarity-test

# 构建产物、运行日志、缓存
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/target
**/logs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/pyxxl.log
